  "solution": {
    "text": "Given lights are of same wavelength and stopping potential is independent on intensity. Hence stopping potential will remain same. Intensity $\\mathrm{I}_2\\gt\\mathrm{I}_1$, hence saturation current corresponding to $\\mathrm{I}_2$ will be greater than that corresponding to $\\mathrm{I}_1$.",
